WEBVTT

00:00.199 --> 00:02.399
Kia ora, and welcome to TMP Layouts

00:02.399 --> 00:04.160
and Dimensions. In the risk

00:04.160 --> 00:05.400
assessment course you learned how

00:05.400 --> 00:07.200
to identify risks and choose

00:07.200 --> 00:08.480
controls.

00:08.480 --> 00:09.679
This course is about the next

00:09.679 --> 00:10.027
step.

00:12.426 --> 00:13.867
turning that plan into a layout

00:13.867 --> 00:15.587
with the right distances. Every

00:15.587 --> 00:16.987
number on a traffic management

00:16.987 --> 00:19.427
diagram, from sign spacing to taper

00:19.427 --> 00:20.054
length

00:22.213 --> 00:23.654
comes from how long people need

00:23.654 --> 00:25.214
to see something, decide what to

00:25.214 --> 00:27.413
do, and act at the speed they're

00:27.413 --> 00:29.973
travelling.

00:31.241 --> 00:32.361
Once you understand where the

00:32.361 --> 00:34.360
numbers come from, you can check

00:34.360 --> 00:36.281
them, explain them,

00:36.281 --> 00:37.801
and change them with confidence

00:37.801 --> 00:39.241
when your risk assessment says you

00:39.241 --> 00:40.108
should.

00:41.228 --> 00:43.348
The first three modules:

00:43.348 --> 00:45.828
design speed and reaction time,

00:45.828 --> 00:50.027
signs, and exclusion zones.

00:50.695 --> 00:52.935
And to finish the six modules:

00:52.935 --> 00:55.215
tapers and delineation, sight

00:55.215 --> 00:57.655
distance and mobile operations and

00:57.655 --> 00:59.415
finally drawing and checking your

00:59.415 --> 01:00.162
diagram.
